Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:32.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 光一闪 穿越片片云彩 想Fly Away （就Fly Away） ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 全景壮阔无垠 身心融入 豁然展开 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 脚一落 就给了地球脸上一踹 来火吗 （请尽管来） ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 给个火山爆发 也毫无大碍 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 要是让北极万年冰也融化 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 若有恐龙活过来 我正好能带它上马戏台 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:11.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:19.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 凡事都能够以不变应万变 天塌下来当被盖 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 但内心的澎湃 谁也不明白 就像骚动的元气弹… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.91,0:01:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 脑袋空空荡荡倒也不坏 正好梦想能满载 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 让笑颜也突破究极的界限 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 今天明天每一天都… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Sparking ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.16,0:02:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:47.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你说啊，快速龙会跟着我的口哨声跳舞了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.40,0:02:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且跳得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔你看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快速龙，要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别吹了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫你别吹了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，短笛叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妨碍你修练了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸，怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.23,0:05:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中午过后就会到达地球了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会撞上地球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用导弹炸掉它不就行了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:24.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛，那星球上有生命反应
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.44,0:05:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生命反应是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是有生物存在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么究竟应该怎么办才好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是用电脑模拟出来的图像
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:59.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果撞上地球，那一切就都完了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球即将毁灭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的时间不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么各位
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.18,0:06:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.99,0:06:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能就这么坐以待毙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.89,0:06:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想结一次婚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是达不到他那种境界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:07:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小林，只要让它偏离现有轨道就行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以毁灭它
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.93,0:07:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.14,0:07:07.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布尔玛再三关照，那星球上有生命反应
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:14.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.45,0:07:18.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果孙君他们失败了，地球就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.20,0:07:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了，悟空，小林
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.72,0:07:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:42.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.27,0:08:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《超级赛亚人孙悟空》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:54.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撞击看样子结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那星球爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸和小林叔叔成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.27,0:09:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是要开始干什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这颗星球已经属于大宇宙之王史拉古大人的了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.79,0:10:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银河系也已经在史拉古大人的支配之中了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.13,0:10:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么大宇宙之王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:25.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:27.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有种不祥的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都起鸡皮疙瘩了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那不是鸡皮，是猪皮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，格奥修，这颗星球要多久能改造好？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.63,0:10:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个嘛，根据着陆后的数据来看似乎很困难
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:11:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么，要怎么做是你的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史拉古大人已经老了，要尽快完成
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个，史拉古大人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想表达
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格奥修，怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是，史拉古大人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要令地轴偏移一点，推进力就足够了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要几天？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:36.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回大人，有十天的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.51,0:11:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢，伽克夏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:45.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回大人，给我三天的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢大人宽限，小的一定尽心尽力去办
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:14.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们真的是想统治地球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.45,0:12:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小鬼是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.17,0:13:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.61,0:13:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琪琪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:21.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看，我也很能打的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.55,0:14:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是龙珠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.79,0:14:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好强的战斗力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.59,0:14:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是坏人的头目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布尔玛，别
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.37,0:14:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那些话不是我说的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们究竟想把我们怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要乖乖顺从于我们，你们就不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.11,0:14:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经统治了好几个星云和星系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大宇宙之王史拉古大人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.53,0:14:36.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会保护你们这颗边境的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:40.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.93,0:14:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史拉古大人非常喜欢这颗年轻又有活力的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们会把地球改造成最新型的星际巡航舰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.46,0:14:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为大人的交通工具
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.74,0:14:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要把地球变成交通工具，这怎么可能办得到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:14:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以我们的科技水平，这是很简单的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.35,0:15:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是靠着我们的科技，地球才没和那颗行星相撞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:06.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.79,0:15:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姑娘，这是龙珠吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我的记忆深处对这个东西有印象
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:19.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能实现任何愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.43,0:15:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想实现愿望必须得收集齐7颗龙珠才行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布尔玛阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要读取你所知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我无关
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.65,0:15:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无关啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.35,0:15:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布尔玛阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实是很棒的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.77,0:16:32.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那玩意儿把剩下的龙珠都找来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.85,0:16:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,限你一小时以内
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一小时？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.04,0:16:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美达马恰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是，乐意效劳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.94,0:17:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来吧，神龙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.81,0:17:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实现我的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.52,0:17:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球被一个可怕的家伙盯上了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说出你的愿望来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何愿望我都可以实现，仅限一个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.30,0:17:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请赐给我永远的年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:57.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到拥有最强大力量的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:18:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太容易了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无敌的年轻时的身体回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有最强力量时期的我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.28,0:18:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的愿望实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我不会老不会死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.36,0:18:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经无所畏惧了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.40,0:18:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我永葆年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:43.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙的边缘也将成为我的囊中之物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快开始对地球进行改造
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.19,0:19:43.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于改造成适合我们魔族生存的星球了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是觉得有点热
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.93,0:19:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们魔族在太阳直射下连一小时也活不了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.91,0:19:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下地球人彻底完了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也省得我们动手了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:20:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的动作还挺快
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.10,0:20:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是龟派气功起作用了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.73,0:20:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么傻话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弥次郎兵卫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了给你们仙豆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.51,0:20:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找得好辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.81,0:20:33.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.35,0:20:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么变成这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.20,0:20:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那云是什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.12,0:20:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我走了，接下来靠你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷得我快要死了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弥次郎兵卫，也给我一颗仙豆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.03,0:20:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀，我都忘了，还有一个小钢珠头在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:20:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.85,0:21:01.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.10,0:21:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.97,0:21:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没办法，接着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:15.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琪琪，你还是别硬撑了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.06,0:21:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一下不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.73,0:21:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，喝碗热汤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且短笛给他的道服也不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来，刚才开始也没看到乌龙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.68,0:21:45.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.69,0:21:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，我们回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.73,0:21:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我冷得不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.03,0:21:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吃一碗热腾腾的拉面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打不过他们的，别勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.71,0:22:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想回去就回去好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.02,0:22:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了，我不走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.29,0:22:07.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.30,0:22:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那儿干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.62,0:22:10.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌龙，这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.48,0:22:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.75,0:22:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.90,0:22:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然来了那么多人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.38,0:22:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办，装死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.01,0:22:51.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,年轻真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.67,0:23:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人数一点都没减
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.97,0:23:17.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射击
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.41,0:23:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.84,0:23:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.01,0:23:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史拉古大人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.11,0:23:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.08,0:23:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.74,0:23:55.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.41,0:23:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，战斗现在才开始
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.73,0:24:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是一群没用的废物
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.39,0:24:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来交给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.30,0:24:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真惨，都被冰封了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.24,0:24:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你还挺能打的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.45,0:24:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，美达马恰，那小鬼归你了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.42,0:24:33.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.19,0:24:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是最倒霉的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.59,0:24:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别小看我了，垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.49,0:24:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.62,0:25:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃得倒挺快的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.22,0:25:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我只会逃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.33,0:25:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.26,0:25:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.22,0:25:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.30,0:25:57.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒是挺顽强的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.24,0:26:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我已经完全看穿你的动作了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.91,0:26:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这招
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.80,0:26:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会把你的能量全部吸干
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.60,0:26:38.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好品尝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.18,0:26:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.56,0:26:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来，给我下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.46,0:27:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我一下子把你收拾了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.20,0:27:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，等等
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.06,0:27:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是魔族中人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.95,0:27:21.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要和我们联手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.70,0:27:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正你也打不过史拉古大人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.06,0:27:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是魔族同仁，明白事理
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.94,0:27:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多洛达波那家伙，真差劲
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.88,0:27:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.09,0:28:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.80,0:28:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来被吸走了相当多的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.14,0:28:13.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我就让你解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.81,0:28:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.01,0:28:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别急，你的对手是我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耍小聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.18,0:28:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休想
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.55,0:28:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢货，已经太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.92,0:28:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.40,0:28:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.46,0:29:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打这种货色弄得我那么狼狈
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.73,0:29:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天真是倒霉透了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.36,0:29:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也结果了这小鬼，一起结伴去阴间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.86,0:29:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.81,0:29:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没必要那么急着想死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.88,0:29:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还满不在乎地送上门来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.92,0:29:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早晚你们都会被冻死的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.16,0:29:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，听人把话说完啊，你这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.83,0:29:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.73,0:29:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.13,0:29:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.64,0:29:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的就交给爸爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.60,0:29:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.81,0:30:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个有趣的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.08,0:30:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不是我的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.85,0:30:11.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了你们好，快把那云一样的东西弄掉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.45,0:30:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后滚出地球
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.80,0:30:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安基拉，你听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.62,0:30:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说我们不是他的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.20,0:30:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个自以为是的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.47,0:30:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来他很看不起我们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.74,0:30:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.39,0:30:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.70,0:30:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.21,0:30:38.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畜生，那个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.20,0:30:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美达马恰
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.76,0:30:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此强悍
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.43,0:30:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.97,0:31:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这混蛋开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.33,0:31:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.02,0:31:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是好机会，美达马恰
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.06,0:31:28.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.25,0:31:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.87,0:32:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没我出场的份了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.68,0:32:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是废物，你们这样也配当我的部下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.29,0:32:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是史拉古吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.05,0:32:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子是赛亚人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.02,0:32:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是地球人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.96,0:32:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快滚出地球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.23,0:32:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是哪里人，正好用你来试试我年轻时的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.57,0:32:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的气
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.11,0:32:43.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我至今为止遇到过的完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.78,0:32:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在该轮到我出场了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.84,0:32:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空，这里交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.68,0:32:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.55,0:32:54.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是他的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.08,0:32:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么只有我会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.19,0:33:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小林
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.19,0:33:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.67,0:33:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了，你就这种程度吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.96,0:33:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原以为你是赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.97,0:33:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.64,0:33:40.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.78,0:33:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.29,0:34:10.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.04,0:34:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即便我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.87,0:34:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修练了那么久
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.98,0:34:26.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也完全打不过他
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.98,0:34:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还能坚持几秒钟呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.63,0:35:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.60,0:35:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，还没结束呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.04,0:36:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么能输呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.34,0:36:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能输
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.82,0:36:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.15,0:36:28.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把力量给我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.34,0:36:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把力量借给我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.52,0:36:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊，悟空，地球已经没有力量可以给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.79,0:36:59.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，差不多该结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.74,0:37:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.46,0:37:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.02,0:37:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.48,0:37:47.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力量在不断提升
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.36,0:38:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空怎么还会有如此强大的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.12,0:38:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道这就是超级赛亚人的力量吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.28,0:38:27.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会如此厉害，那家伙究竟
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.23,0:38:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到你能把我逼到如此地步
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.20,0:38:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我也让你看看我真正的实力
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.29,0:39:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.60,0:39:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.31,0:39:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了，悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.91,0:39:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是界王吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.11,0:39:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史拉古和地球的神仙一样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.80,0:39:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是当时在那美克星面临毁灭危机时
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.82,0:39:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被送到史拉古星去的那美克星婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.93,0:39:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他不是普通的那美克星人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.91,0:40:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了，是看到我的真面目后害怕了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.10,0:40:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕连他本人也没有察觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.29,0:40:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于罕见的气候异变
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.52,0:40:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他天生一颗邪恶之心在不断成长
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.25,0:40:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样一来，他的邪念就连神仙分身的短笛也无法企及
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.07,0:40:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为史拉古是100%的邪恶体
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.34,0:40:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是超级那美克星人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.40,0:40:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级那美克星人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.20,0:40:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我的这个推测没错的话
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.15,0:40:41.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就连弗利萨，不，连超级赛亚人可能也不是他的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.40,0:41:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.53,0:41:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，你要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.95,0:41:51.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.50,0:42:02.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没完
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.53,0:42:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.27,0:42:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.44,0:42:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.94,0:42:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打得很棒，不过到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.01,0:42:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.79,0:42:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是那美克星人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.12,0:42:59.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.86,0:43:01.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对你的弱点了如指掌
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.99,0:43:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.00,0:43:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟敢来搅局
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.11,0:43:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.50,0:43:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你笑什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.30,0:43:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.40,0:43:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，吹口哨
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.12,0:43:31.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你上次吹给我听的口哨
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.26,0:43:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口哨
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.82,0:43:36.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让快速龙跳舞的那个口哨
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.30,0:43:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快吹
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.03,0:43:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.60,0:43:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快吹口哨
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.40,0:43:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口哨
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.70,0:44:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，吹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.89,0:44:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快吹
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.25,0:44:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你想玩什么花样
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.70,0:44:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我都是没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.96,0:44:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吹，悟饭，吹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.80,0:44:23.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.40,0:44:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.55,0:44:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.92,0:44:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了，你就痛苦去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.58,0:44:35.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.52,0:44:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你才把自己的耳朵给…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.52,0:44:40.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.86,0:44:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像人类讨厌割玻璃时的刺耳声那样
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.94,0:44:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对那美克星人来说
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.16,0:44:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类口哨声的波长可能也非常刺耳
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.00,0:44:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刺激到了神经，难以忍受
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.14,0:44:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.25,0:45:03.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.42,0:45:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.58,0:45:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来就拜托了，悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.72,0:45:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.09,0:45:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会白费你的一番心意的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.10,0:45:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住口
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.40,0:46:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别吹了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.81,0:46:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史拉古大人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.05,0:46:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.00,0:46:16.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,界王拳
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.21,0:46:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这股气是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.54,0:46:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.40,0:46:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.40,0:46:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.65,0:46:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空赢了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.06,0:46:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.59,0:46:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，接下来是那片云
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.04,0:47:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史拉古
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.06,0:47:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳啊，现在只能靠你了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.42,0:47:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把元气分给我一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.40,0:47:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.50,0:47:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.41,0:47:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元气弹
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.48,0:48:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空啊，干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.72,0:48:33.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史拉古为了扩张自己的势力范围
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.30,0:48:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手伸向地球正是失败的根源
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.80,0:48:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来，能打败超级那美克星人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.23,0:48:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空说不定还真是超级赛亚人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.20,0:48:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.05,0:48:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.40,0:48:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.72,0:49:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弥次郎兵卫
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.68,0:49:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道会搞成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.10,0:49:07.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你们送仙豆来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.26,0:49:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得好听，明明一直躲在那里了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.36,0:49:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.80,0:49:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我其实
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.80,0:49:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.57,0:49:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.54,0:49:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要仙豆
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.01,0:49:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.12,0:49:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.89,0:49:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔，你的耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.90,0:49:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是短笛叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.56,0:50:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.62,0:50:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也是好天气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.00,0:50:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一，二，三，四
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.92,0:50:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二，二，三，四
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.62,0:50:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三，二，三，四
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.17,0:50:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 怎么了？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.54,0:50:33.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 到底为什么 垂头丧气低着头？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.22,0:50:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 快昂首挺胸吧 绽放出你的笑容 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.68,0:50:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 让他们瞧瞧你的力量 （源源不绝 可放可收） ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.69,0:50:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 既然有值得你讨厌的事 就大声地去怒吼 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.61,0:50:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 咚咚波 （咚咚波！） ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.65,0:51:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 虽然磕磕绊绊 自己的路还是要一往无前地走 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.45,0:51:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 龟派气功波 （龟派气功波！） ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.70,0:51:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 危机就在眼前 怒火爆发后飞踢吧 把困难全都打倒 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.46,0:51:11.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 界王拳 （界王拳！） ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.58,0:51:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 学如逆水行舟 保持身心健康去用功才最重要 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.55,0:51:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 元气弹 （元气弹！） ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.63,0:51:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 拿谁和你比较 就算是邻居的小孩也 把苦恼全都打倒 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.56,0:51:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 就拜托你了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.39,0:51:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 怎么样 现在神清气爽了吧… ∮
